  "description": "Large Stage 1 encounters (decisions.md L-30, doc/large-stages.md). Areas run along +X (the zones). Entering area N fills area N+1. Hidden entries stand inside every region the route reaches, on its own tier, so raised spaces get arrivals too. safe_zones: the middle safe zone (L-24). raids: timed mobs and specials only in the large travel zones. Small watcher packs (3) stand right on the main route in every large zone, so a run meets a few it cannot walk around (wanderers, pacing-pressure-plan.md 4.2). Groups with after = mission are placed when the shutter opens, on the way back from the panel (L-27). All counts and radii are [임시] starting values. Tutorial (L-34): prologue areas p_* before the street, no waves there; the first yard has exactly two zombies (fixed: not scaled for the party); bases P3, P6 and C1 are safe zones.",
